Control-feel scripts: MeterCapture drag scripts on a plug-in's real editor (they move the real mouse). Run them from
build/meters with MC=../MeterCapture_artefacts/Release/MeterCapture.exe and NT=../../scripts/feel exported:
  run_feel.sh      50 px drags (slow / fast, plain / Ctrl) and 3-notch wheel moves on each control
  scan_thumb.sh    finds a fader's thumb (where a drag takes)
  fader_feel.sh    drag rates from the default thumbs, a fresh session per mode
  ctrl_feel.sh     200 px Ctrl drags in mouse steps of 1, 2, 3 and 10 px, a fresh session per step size
  midctrl_feel.sh  Ctrl pressed or released half way through a drag, a fresh session per mode
Logs are parsed by read_drags_any.py in this folder. Results: plugins/FwBassXLift/MEASUREMENTS.md, section 10 (Wheel and Ctrl
across the suite's references).
